    "shapeReason": {
      "observations.*.tree entries under assets/temp": "the pinned route unlinks assets/temp/<name> after the response is sent, which races the write stream's handle close on Windows: the file survives in some runs and not others (the committed fixture once recorded temp/note.txt; four consecutive re-records of the same input recorded none), so no value under assets/temp is host-independent. Entries under assets/temp are dropped from every recorded tree; the temp DIRECTORY is kept because ensureFoldersExist creates it deterministically."
    }
  },
